<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #000;
  }
  h1, h2 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 50%;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">OF WYOMING</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Human Resources Department</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Dept. <span data-field="department_number">{{ department_number }}</span> • <span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span>, <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(<span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>) • Fax (<span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span>) • www.<span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span>/hr</p>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">Certification of Retirement</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Retiree's Name</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
        <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Empl ID</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
        <span data-field="employee_id">{{ employee_id }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Retirement Date</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="retirement_date">{{ retirement_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <p>This form must be completed and submitted to the Human Resources Office if you terminate your employment and desire to withdraw or rollover money from a University of Wyoming sponsored 401(a), 403(b), or 457(b) retirement account.</p>
    <p>Normally, you must be retired to access money in one of these retirement accounts. An exception is for the 403(b) account if you are at least <span data-field="minimum_age">{{ minimum_age }}</span> year old. To be considered to be retired, there must be a bona fide break in service as defined by the Internal Revenue Code (IRC). You are not considered to be retired if you have a pre-existing arrangement to return to work following your retirement or any promise of future employment with the University of Wyoming.</p>
    <p>Each of these retirement plans sponsored by the University of Wyoming is subject to qualification by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS). This qualification is predicated upon compliance with the IRC and other federal law. Lack of compliance with these federal mandates threatens the qualified tax status of the plans. The University of Wyoming must demonstrate bona fide separations of service to protect the retirement plans' qualified status.</p>
    <p>By signing below, I certify that I am retiring from the University of Wyoming and have no promise of future employment with the University of Wyoming.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Signature of Retiree</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p style="margin-top: 5px;">&nbsp;</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Date</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p style="margin-top: 5px;">&nbsp;</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 150px; font-size: 9pt;">
    <p>The University of Wyoming is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action Employer</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 30px;">
    Revised <span data-field="revision_date">{{ revision_date }}</span>
  </div>
</div>